    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;The Legend of Nezha&quot;, players will transform into the owner of an inn. They will have a complete and rich set of service functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will meticulously simulate various massage techniques, which can all be precisely applied to the game characters through the players' operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can help the guests with massages by simply clicking the mouse, relieving their fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes hot spring scenes and restaurant scenes, which can enable players to be more immersed in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a rich mission system in the game. Players can complete missions to obtain generous rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, there is a free lucky draw turntable, which provides players with a rich gaming experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;The Legend of Nezha&quot;, players will transform into the owner of an inn. They will have a complete and rich set of service functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will meticulously simulate various massage techniques, which can all be precisely applied to the game characters through the players' operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can help the guests with massages by simply clicking the mouse, relieving their fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes hot spring scenes and restaurant scenes, which can enable players to be more immersed in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a rich mission system in the game. Players can complete missions to obtain generous rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, there is a free lucky draw turntable, which provides players with a rich gaming experience.</p>",
